    {
      "name": "Service health: partition chosen by the key (service-health)",
      "description": "The key is the service, so every event of a service lands in the same partition and is read in the order it happened. The topic keeps its events for 30 days: run a consumer with a new KAFKA_GROUP_ID and it reads them all again.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Outage of payments-api -> partition 2",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
